reliikviaga, on ju, et

161
00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:55.320
siis see on hästi oluline.

162
00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:59.090
On on olemas autod,
mida nagu tahad teha,

163
00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:02.180
